5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's make sure we pick a place that's fair for everyone's wallet this year!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I hope we can find a place that helps our members bond across different ages.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to consider the administrative burden on the organizers to avoid burnout.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just want to make sure we actually get some sleep so we can train hard!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We must be precise about the total costs before we announce anything to the club.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, maybe we should check the transport receipts to see where the money goes?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if the seniors have any advice on how to get the year-groups mixing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the booking process for public facilities to see how complex it is.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the beds and how people actually slept last time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"That's a good point, Mio. I'll look into the transport and the building let terms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check the whole-building let terms and the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the seniors' views and the attendance sheets as well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll also check the cooking duty records from last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll check the accounts from other clubs that went inland and the rate sheets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll add the prefecture rate sheet to my list.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
