35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It seems like some people just don't show up, and late cancellations are a financial risk.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've learned that shared evening spaces are key for mixing, but many members skip away camps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Public bookings are a nightmare of paperwork, and cooking for ourselves is a huge time sink.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are cheap, but other clubs said the sleeping conditions were quite strict and crowded.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Transport is a massive part of the budget, and fixed-headcount lets are risky if people drop out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if cooking is a problem, maybe a place with a kitchen is better?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we stay local, will we actually spend the evenings together?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly, Mio. A place with staff would save the organizers hours of work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm worried that ""cheap"" public beds mean poor sleep, which ruins the training.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the non-refundable deposits for whole buildings make the ""flat fee"" very dangerous.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, so we should avoid the lodge if we can't guarantee attendance?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But the lodge would keep everyone in one building all evening.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The public center is too much paperwork for the organizers to handle again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to be eight people to a room with an eleven o'clock curfew.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"We need a balance between cost, effort, and reliability.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
