60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Campus is safe for the budget, but the lodge sounds like a fun adventure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The lodge is the only way to ensure the year-groups actually bond.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Campus is the least stressful for the organizers, provided we have a plan.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'll vote for Campus; I'd rather have my own space than a crowded dorm.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Campus minimizes transport costs, which is the biggest financial variable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"But if we stay on campus, do we actually feel like we're at a ""camp""?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the bonding is more important than the location.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, we can't ignore the fact that some members never attend away trips.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Plus, the lodge is two prefectures away! That's a lot of travel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,The financial risk of the lodge is too high given the attendance history.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I see. If the lodge is too risky, I'll go with Campus.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I still worry about the social aspect, but I won't block the majority.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Campus is the most rational choice for the organizers' sanity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Agreed. Let's keep it simple and local.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,It's the only way to ensure we don't end up with another deficit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
